  "transcript": [
    {
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 13400,
      "text": "You will hear a trainee teacher called Eve talking to her university tutor about her"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 13400,
      "endMs": 16700,
      "text": "preparations for teaching practice."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 16700,
      "endMs": 21200,
      "text": "Before you listen, you have some time to look at questions 21 to 25."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 30000,
      "endMs": 51000,
      "text": "Now, listen and answer questions 21 to 25."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 51000,
      "endMs": 56000,
      "text": "Tutor: Hello, Eve. Come in and sit down. How's it going?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 56000,
      "endMs": 60000,
      "text": "Eve: Hi, thanks. I'm looking forward to my teaching practice next week."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 60000,
      "endMs": 68000,
      "text": "Tutor: Good. Now, you've got two classes, haven't you? Year three and Year six. Have you done your lesson plans?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 68000,
      "endMs": 75000,
      "text": "Eve: Well, I've decided to take the topic of renewable energy. I haven't done a lesson plan for Year six yet,"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 75000,
      "endMs": 80000,
      "text": "but I thought I'd base their lesson on an example of very simple technology."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 80000,
      "endMs": 85000,
      "text": "So, I've brought this diagram to show you. I got it from the internet."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 85000,
      "endMs": 93000,
      "text": "Tutor: Let's see. A biogas plant. So, this is equipment for producing fuel from organic waste."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 93000,
      "endMs": 99000,
      "text": "Eve: Yes. The smaller container on the left is where you put the waste you've collected."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 99000,
      "endMs": 104000,
      "text": "Tutor: Right. And from there, it's piped into the larger tank."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 104000,
      "endMs": 109000,
      "text": "Eve: That's right. And that's slurry on the base of the larger tank."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 109000,
      "endMs": 113000,
      "text": "Tutor: Right. And what exactly is slurry?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 113000,
      "endMs": 117000,
      "text": "Eve: It's a mixture of organic waste and water."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 117000,
      "endMs": 121000,
      "text": "Tutor: So, is that pipe at the bottom where the water comes in?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 121000,
      "endMs": 128000,
      "text": "Eve: Yes, it is. As the slurry mixture digests, it produces gas, and that rises to the top of the dome."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 128000,
      "endMs": 135000,
      "text": "Then, when it's needed, it can be piped off for use as fuel in homes or factories. It's very simple."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 135000,
      "endMs": 140000,
      "text": "Tutor: I suppose there's some kind of safety valve to prevent pressure buildup."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 140000,
      "endMs": 144000,
      "text": "Eve: That's the overflow tank. That container on the right."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 144000,
      "endMs": 148000,
      "text": "As the slurry expands, some of it flows into that."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 148000,
      "endMs": 153000,
      "text": "And then, once some of the gas has been piped off, the slurry level goes down again."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 153000,
      "endMs": 156000,
      "text": "And the overflow tank empties again."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 156000,
      "endMs": 161000,
      "text": "Tutor: I see. Well, I think that's suitably simple for the age level it's for."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 161000,
      "endMs": 163000,
      "text": "I look forward to seeing the whole lesson plan."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 163000,
      "endMs": 167000,
      "text": "Eve: Thanks. And can I show you my ideas for the year three lesson?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 167000,
      "endMs": 171000,
      "text": "Tutor: Of course. Let's look."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 171000,
      "endMs": 178000,
      "text": "Before you listen to the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 26 to 30."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 197000,
      "endMs": 206000,
      "text": "Now listen and answer questions 26 to 30."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 206000,
      "endMs": 215000,
      "text": "Eve: I thought I'd introduce the topic by writing the word energy on the board and reinforcing the spelling and the pronunciation."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 215000,
      "endMs": 221000,
      "text": "Then I'll do a little mime, you know, run on the spot or something to convey the sense."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 221000,
      "endMs": 224000,
      "text": "Tutor: I'd keep it brief at this stage."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 224000,
      "endMs": 233000,
      "text": "Eve: Yes, I will. Then I'll wipe the word off and write the question, where does energy come from and see what the pupils come up with?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 233000,
      "endMs": 240000,
      "text": "Tutor: Fine. I suggest that you just brainstorm at this stage and don't reject any of their suggestions."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 240000,
      "endMs": 243000,
      "text": "Eve: Yes. That's what I was going to do."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 243000,
      "endMs": 252000,
      "text": "Then I've produced a set of simple statements like, energy makes cars move along the road and energy makes our bodies grow."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 252000,
      "endMs": 254000,
      "text": "There are eight altogether."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 254000,
      "endMs": 259000,
      "text": "Tutor: Are you going to give them out as a handout or write them up on the board?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 259000,
      "endMs": 264000,
      "text": "Eve: First, them up on the board and then I'll read them out loud."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 264000,
      "endMs": 267000,
      "text": "And I'll get the pupils to copy them out in their notebooks."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 267000,
      "endMs": 273000,
      "text": "I'll also ask them to think up one more similar statement by themselves and add it to the list."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 273000,
      "endMs": 275000,
      "text": "Tutor: Good idea."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 275000,
      "endMs": 286000,
      "text": "Eve: After that, I thought I'd vary things a bit by sticking some pictures up of things like the sun and plants and food and petrol and a running child."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 286000,
      "endMs": 293000,
      "text": "And I'll get the pupils to work out what order the pictures should come in in terms of the energy chain."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 293000,
      "endMs": 299000,
      "text": "Tutor: I think that's a very good idea. You could move the pictures around as the pupils give you directions."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 299000,
      "endMs": 302000,
      "text": "Eve: Yes. I think they'd enjoy that."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 302000,
      "endMs": 309000,
      "text": "And to finish off, I've made a gap fill exercise to give out. They'll be doing that individually."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 309000,
      "endMs": 313000,
      "text": "And while they're writing, I'll walk round and check their work."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 313000,
      "endMs": 322000,
      "text": "Tutor: Good. And have you worked out the timing of all that? It'll probably take you right through to the end of the lesson."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 322000,
      "endMs": 328000,
      "text": "That is the end of Part 3. You now have half a minute to check your answers."
    },
